Package: kmod-keys-encrypted
Version: 6.18.13-r1
Depends: kernel (=6.18.13~0f6bd33d7b96952ab37b985ed7cb6b40-r1), kmod-crypto-cbc, kmod-crypto-hmac, kmod-crypto-rng, kmod-crypto-sha256, kmod-keys-trusted
